hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1755","`Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (may Allah be pleased with him) said that` the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""On the Day of Resurrection, death will be brought in the form of a ram, which will be piebald. Then a caller will call out: O people of Paradise! They will raise their necks and look, and when they see it, (the angel) will say: Do you recognize this? They will say: Yes, this is death, and all of them had seen it (at the time of their own death), so they will recognize it. Then he will call out: O people of Hell! They too will raise their necks and look, and (the angel) will say: Do you recognize this? They will say: Yes, this is death, and all of them had also seen it (at the time of their own death). Then, at that moment, death will be slaughtered, and (the angel) will say: O people of Paradise! Now you will remain in Paradise forever, and no one will die. And O people of Hell! Now you will remain in Hell forever, and no one will die. (At that time, the people of Hell will regret.)"" Then (the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him) recited this verse: ""(O Muhammad!) And warn them of the Day of Regret, when the matter will be decided, and they are heedless and do not believe."" (Surah Maryam: 39)"
